    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-06",
      "text": "手机又提示存储空间不足",
      "content_type": "text",
      "label": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-07",
      "text": "邻居家的狗每天早上叫",
      "content_type": "text",
      "label": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-08",
      "text": "今天买菜花了五十块",
      "content_type": "text",
      "label": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-09",
      "text": "淘宝上买的小夜灯到了",
      "content_type": "text",
      "label": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-10",
      "text": "地铁上看到一个有趣的广告",
      "content_type": "text",
      "label": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-11",
      "text": "天气转凉,记得加衣服",
      "content_type": "text",
      "label": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-12",
      "text": "小区门口新开了水果店",
      "content_type": "text",
      "label": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-13",
      "text": "今天通勤路况出奇的好",
      "content_type": "text",
      "label": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-mixed-14",
      "text": "楼下的桂花开了",
